      "writtenOn": "2023-11-22T18:51:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found recovery sends the sysjump command to the EC and warm-resets the AP. Thus, the SHUTDOWN_COMPLETE hook won\u0027t be used. So, reboot in the current recovery process won\u0027t be affected by this CL (whether we choose AP_OFF or AP_ON as a default behavior).",
